# Postgres and pgvector

- Parameterized queries only. Enable `vector` with `CREATE EXTENSION IF NOT EXISTS vector`.
- For this product schema (ARCHITECTURE.md §5), embeddings are `vector(1536)` with cosine HNSW (`vector_cosine_ops`) — not `halfvec` — unless a future migration explicitly changes that.
- Schema and migrations live in `packages/db`. Use Drizzle (`drizzle-pgvector` skill).
- Follow installed skills: `postgres`, `design-postgres-tables`, `schema-exploration`, `postgres-database-migration`, `pgvector-semantic-search`, `postgres-hybrid-text-search`, `drizzle-pgvector`.
- When Postgres MCP is connected, inspect live schema before guessing table shapes. Keep MCP restricted/read-only for exploration.
